module that performs a three-stage pipelined computation of a * b + c, followed by an XOR reduction on the 30-bit result. The module takes 15-bit unsigned inputs a, b, and c, and produces a 15-bit unsigned output out. The computation is pipelined with each stage synchronized to the positive edge of the clock. The module is designed to be synthesizable and should work in any FPGA or other synthesis tool that supports Verilog 1995 or later. 
`timescale 1ns/1ns
