module named Mux8. The module takes a 3-bit select signal and eight 8-bit data inputs and outputs the selected data based on the select signal. The select signal is used to index into the input data bus and the selected data is passed to the output port data_o. The multiplexer is implemented using a case statement within an always block, which is sensitive to all inputs. The Size parameter specifies the width of the data inputs and outputs, and it defaults to 8. The module does not contain a clock or reset, indicating purely combinational logic with no sequential elements.
